<title>USA: Jostens Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Jostens Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.26		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			  9,954		    6,773</p>
<p> Revs		     150,437		  141,863</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,711		   38,632</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net reflects $0.09 a share earnings increase as a result of new inventory cost accounting system and a charge against earnings of $3.0 million or $0.05 a share to close a manufacturing facility.</p>
